  "description": "<p><font color='#808080' style='font-size: inherit; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next; font-weight: 600;'><font size='3'>Do not download this parcel map service as a shapefile - you will get an error. To download a zipped file geodatabase, go to this Hub item:&nbsp;<\/font><\/font><a href='https://egis-lacounty.hub.arcgis.com/datasets/parcels' style='font-size: inherit; font-family: var(--fontsBaseFamily),Avenir Next; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 600;' rel='nofollow ugc'>https://egis-lacounty.hub.arcgis.com/datasets/parcels<\/a><br /><\/p><p><font color='#808080'><font size='3' style=''><span style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><font>This&nbsp;map service provides information about properties and parcel boundaries in the County of Los Angeles. The&nbsp;Office of the Assessor (<\/font><\/span><\/font><a href='https://assessor.lacounty.gov/' style='' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>click here for their website<\/a><font size='3' style=''><span style='font-family:tahoma, arial, sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'>) maintains <\/span><span style='font-family:tahoma, arial, sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'>assessment records of real and personal property in the County of Los Angeles, as well as a GIS Tax Parcel Base Map. &nbsp;The Assessor has recently <\/span><span style='font-family:tahoma, arial, sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'>changed its policies and will be releasing a number of datasets publicly over time. They will be available here, as well as on the County\u2019s Open Data Portal (<\/span><\/font><a href='https://assessor.lacounty.gov/open-data-initiative/' style='' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>click here to learn more<\/a><font size='3' style=''><span style='font-family:tahoma, arial, sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'>). &nbsp;To access the Property Assessment Information System, where you can search for properties and see maps and imagery,&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><a href='https://assessor.lacounty.gov/property-assessment-information-system/' style='' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>go to the PAIS website.<\/a><\/font><div><font color='#808080'><font size='3' style=''><br /><\/font><\/font><\/div><div><font color='#808080'><font size='3' style=''>All inquiries should be directed to the Mapping &amp; GIS Services Section, LA County Office of the Assessor at gisinfo@assessor.lacounty.gov<br /><\/font><\/font><\/div><\/p>",
